// A Pololu Romi with its bumper switches: the Romi that drives (its kit, the Motor Driver and Power Distribution Board
// and six AA cells), and a board of three snap-action switches screwed onto each half of the front deck. The cells behind
// the axles are what keeps it on its caster with the switches out in front.
